# Normalise line endings in the repository so a clone looks the same on every
# OS. This is not cosmetic: scripts/set_version.py parses Cargo.lock and
# package-lock.json with patterns written against LF, and a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true turned those files into CRLF — which failed the v2.0.5
# release build. Text files stay LF in the working tree too; binaries are left
# completely alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
